After playing this game several times this week and having people request playing this game more than any other I need to make inserts to now. Never done it so How do I start?&nbsp;FoamCour- Where do you get it and how do you work with it.I like SqrlGrl Plano boxes, where&nbsp;did&nbsp;you get them? But getting others to help me add invader will help with me getting burned out of this game. Is there another option?&nbsp;

